   "is_accepted": false,
   "permalink": "https://stackoverflow.com/a/32892090",
   "score": 16,
   "created_utc": "2015-10-01T16:06:04Z",
   "last_edit_utc": null,
   "last_activity_utc": "2015-10-01T16:06:04Z",
   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "<p>I think the shortest and clearest solution would be:</p>\n\n<pre><code>std::vector&lt;Object*&gt; container = ... ;\nfor (Object* obj : container)\n    delete obj;\ncontainer.clear();\n</code></pre>\n"
